# NAME

traceroute6 - the routers on the way to a machine, by IPv6

# SYNOPSIS

*traceroute6* [_option_...] _host_ [_packetlen_]

# DESCRIPTION

traceroute6 is *traceroute -6*, as on Linux: it finds the way to _host_
over IPv6, with the options and the output of *traceroute*(8) (ADR
0345).

# SEE ALSO

*traceroute*(8), *mtr*(8), *ping*(8)
